{
  "_comment": [
    "Hoenn & Seek 2.0 part 12: secret base spots at the reopened legendary sites.",
    "tools/hoenn/gen_hoenn_base_spots.py writes each spot's closed entrance metatile into the",
    "layout (collision 1, elevation 0, like Emerald's own spots) and adds a secret_base bg event.",
    "x,y is the wall tile; the player stands on the tile below it, facing up, and uses Secret Power.",
    "id: the base's group (which interior you get) and a free variant (Emerald uses 1-4, so 9 is",
    "always free). The indent colour should match the group (red/blue/yellow cave).",
    "Constants go to include/constants/hoenn_secret_bases.h. Re-runs are idempotent.",
    "chambers (part 12b): new base groups 24+ with their own interior. template = the base map whose",
    "layout and objects are copied; computer = where you stand the first time (in front of the PC);",
    "tileset.from = the cave base whose tiles are used; floor/wall/outline = palette 6's colours",
    "2-5, 6-9 and 1 (picked from mockups made with tools/hoenn/render_layout.py: Sky Pillar's",
    "lavender stone and tan parapets, the Sealed Chamber's sand and dark rock).",
    "johto_kanto_spots (2.0 part 13a): same fields on HnS maps; 'entrance' names a host in base_entrances.json, 'walkable' tiles get collision 0, variants 5-8 (9 is the sites')."
  ],
